ey_Sunshine","",[],"<p>This is the appropriate response.</p>"],[2,6696570,6693938,2,0,2,"2016-10-31T15:03:47","thrus","",[],"<p>I was thinking emotional distress due to having believed that it was only sperm she wanted and not a father figure and now you have to worry for the rest of your life about how the child will cope with you not having been there during the formative years. This is a case that can be filed after the results of hers is done and is valid if she wins.</p>"],[1,6693997,0,12,0,12,"2016-10-31T03:31:31","weezkitty","",[],"<p>Fuck child support. Now in a world that women work just as much as men, it should be abolished</p>"],[2,6694277,6693997,7,0,7,"2016-10-31T04:30:50","ElectroGypsy","",[],"<p>I'd go as far as saying same goes for alimony. </p>"],[3,6694392,6694277,1,0,1,"2016-10-31T04:51:39","weezkitty","",[],"<p>Even more so</p>"],[3,6696063,6694277,1,0,1,"2016-10-31T13:43:09","Redditsdead","",[],"<p>At least alimony doesn't last until the youngest is out of college. Two years is the average they make dudes pay alimony. </p>\n<p>My old boss was paying alimony out the nose, as well as child support, even though all the kids lived with him. They hated her. But, if he challenged it at all, she would drag the kids back and make everyone's lives a living hell. Fuck crazy bitches. Well don't, actually. If you do, wrap it up </p>"],[1,6694170,0,2,0,2,"2016-10-31T04:07:30","collegetoker","",[],"<p>This dude was in the clear to being childfree for life! He was gay and he still managed to get hooked for child support! </p>"],[1,6694238,0,0,0,0,"2016-10-31T04:21:36","Prettylion","",[],"<p>There has to be something under contract law that the defendant can apply. That is a obvious breach. God dam I hate arseholes </p>"],[1,6694510,0,0,0,0,"2016-10-31T05:17:03","SelfReferenceParadox","",[],"<p>Remember! This is somehow the fault of men!</p>"],[1,6694639,0,1,0,1,"2016-10-31T05:46:38","derram","",[],"<p><a href=\"https://tweetsave.com/coraxnews/status/792819137